    /// A calendar month of charging, per person.
    ///
    /// One row for each person who charged in the month, named, with how many
    /// sessions, what they charged, what it came to including tax and the average
    /// price per kWh; and one row, last, for sessions nobody was tagged on, which
    /// are never attributed to anyone. The month is the calendar month in each
    /// location's own time zone.
    ///
    /// The board gets totals per person and not when anyone charged: the board are
    /// the residents' neighbours, and a record of the times shows when someone is
    /// home or away. The times are on the person's own statement and in Flowion
    /// Home.
    ///
    /// An open month is computed live from the sessions and the day-ahead prices,
    /// so a figure can change (`state.kind` is `open`). A **closed** month
    /// (`state.kind` is `closed`, with who closed it and when) is shown exactly as
    /// it was stored: every figure and every name is fixed, and the sessions that
    /// reached the project after the close are listed in `state.arrivedAfterClose`
    /// and in no figure.
